%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b1ce7e6b2aaa1fb408b54e6f771d8d4f, type: 3}
  m_Name: New CSV Reader
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  TextCsv: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 02bbaa12a92db3c4a974ae105d095e25, type: 3}
  AllTexts:
    SmallTexts:
    - ID: dialogue ID
      Text: Text
      animation: Emotion
    - ID: char1_day1_part1
      Text: Greetings, Mortal. My servants tell me I can get my attire cleaned in
        this esteemed... establishment?
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part1_responce1
      Text: (Dry) Correct, I clean clothes.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part1_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Yes, silly! Didn't you see the huge neon sign that says "Clean
        for the Mean"?
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part1_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Nice, looks like word of my "esteemed establishment" got around.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part2
      Text: Indeed. Would you be able to return this shirt to its original, pristine
        condition?
      animation: sad
    - ID: char1_day1_part3
      Text: Tell me, are you experienced in cleaning blood stains?
      animation: happy
    - ID: char1_day1_part3_responce1
      Text: (Dry) I'm in business with evil. Getting rid of blood is my bread and
        butter.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part3_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Oh, that's a big one! The other guy didn't live to tell the
        tale, I imagine. Good on you!
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part3_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Blood? That looks more like wine to me, Pookie.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part4_lowPoints
      Text: It's a big stain and I can assure you it's blood. Blood indeed.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part5_lowPoints
      Text: And not wine at all...
      animation: sad
    - ID: char1_day1_part6_lowPoints
      Text: I should know, I'm a Vampire Elder. Baronex Duskmantle of Midnight's
        Keep to be exact.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char1_day1_part6_lowPoints_responce1
      Text: (Dry) It smells like wine, it looks like wine. I will treat it like wine.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part6_lowPoints_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) But it smells like... Ooh, got it. Of course dear Baronex, I
        will totally get rid of this BLOOD stain for you!
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part6_lowPoints_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Whatever the stain, I'll make sure to get that shirt back on
        you asap.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part7_lowPoints
      Text: I shall return to collect the garment tomorrow. I hope your services
        will please my sophisticated taste.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char1_day1_part4_highPoints
      Text: It's a big stain and I can assure you it's blood. Blood indeed.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part5_highPoints
      Text: My victim lost a lot of it when I fed on them last night. I'm a Vampire
        Elder, you see.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char1_day1_part6_highPoints
      Text: "Baronex Duskmantle of Midnight's Keep to be exact. Enchant\xE9..."
      animation: happy
    - ID: char1_day1_part7_highPoints
      Text: Pray do tell, have you ever worked for a Vampire before? Most common
        folk find us most... frightening.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char1_day1_part7_highPoints_responce1
      Text: (Dry) Most my clientele is dangerous. I am confident my excellent services
        will keep me in business. And alive.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part7_highPoints_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) A real Vampire Elder? I'm positively thrilled! But don't worry.
        I'm not scared. Most my clients are kinda dangerous.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part7_highPoints_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) I got many dangerous customers but none look as sharp as you.
        The bloodlust suits you well.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part8_highPoints
      Text: You are a gutsy one! Living here amongst such murderous creatures can't
        be easy.
      animation: happy
    - ID: char1_day1_part9_highPoints
      Text: Sometimes even a Vampire can feel discouraged around such marvelous villainy.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day1_part10_highPoints
      Text: Especially if this theoretical Vampire was inept at hunting prey...
      animation: sad
    - ID: char1_day1_part11_highPoints
      Text: Which is not me, of course! I'm an exceptional hunterex! Confirmed by
        the blood stains on my shirt which are NOT wine at all.
      animation: happy
    - ID: char1_day1_part12_highPoints
      Text: I'm looking forward to collect my garment tomorrow. And to see you again,
        dear Mortal.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char2_day1_part1
      Text: Hey, you the one doin' laundry, right?
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part2
      Text: I got some oil on this work-overall. Can you get it out?
      animation: sad
    - ID: char2_day1_part2_responce1
      Text: (Dry) Certainly. Looks like motor oil. Shouldn't be a problem.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part2_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Sticky stuff, but I can get it out. I don't want a cutie like
        you running around with motor oil stains.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part2_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Motor oil, synthetic blend. Stubborn, but I'll get it out.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part3
      Text: Yeah, I needed to fix somethin' on my Mistress's orbital laser.
      animation: happy
    - ID: char2_day1_part4
      Text: Got quite dirty in the process.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char2_day1_part5
      Text: 'You know how Super Villains are: The bigger the laser, the better.'
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part5_responce1
      Text: (Dry) Super Villains. Most of them are just rich brats, not understanding
        the intricacies of crime.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part5_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Gotta love a big laser! And a dirty henchwoman.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part5_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Well, you need a big laser to scare the shit out of these plebs.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part6_lowPoints
      Text: 'Yeah, whatever... I need this overall cleaned. '
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part7_lowPoints
      Text: If you don't suck, I'll come back. I'm sure my Mistress will have me
        crawl inside some machinery again soon.
      animation: sad
    - ID: char2_day1_part8_lowPoints
      Text: She is quite...
      animation: happy
    - ID: char2_day1_part8_lowPoints_responce1
      Text: (Dry) ...
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part8_lowPoints_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Cool?
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part8_lowPoints_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Incompetent? Annoying?
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part9_lowPoints
      Text: Demanding.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char2_day1_part10_lowPoints
      Text: Anyway, I'm out. Do your job well and I'll return with more shit to clean.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part6_highPoints
      Text: You sound like you know what you're talking about. I respect that.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char2_day1_part7_highPoints
      Text: These higher-ups act like they are the shit but they don't know that
        people like us make the world go round.
      animation: sad
    - ID: char2_day1_part8_highPoints
      Text: I'll be a good customer for you, ya know. My Mistress has me climb in
        all sort of shit.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part9_highPoints
      Text: So I have a lot of laundry that needs taking care of.
      animation: flirty
    - ID: char2_day1_part9_highPoints_responce1
      Text: (Dry) I always take care of my customers.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part9_highPoints_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) I'd love to take care of you- ehm... Of your clothing.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part9_highPoints_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Just don't bring in anything too nasty. I don't do contagious
        stuff.
      animation: default
    - ID: char2_day1_part10_highPoints
      Text: Right. Just get that oil stain out and I'll be happy as a clam.
      animation: happy
    - ID: char2_day1_part11_highPoints
      Text: And trust me, you don't want to see me unhappy.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part1
      Text: Gree...tings. Mo- mo... ortal...
      animation: sad
    - ID: char1_day2_part1_responce1
      Text: (Dry) Hello.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part1_responce2
      Text: (Bubbly) Are you okay? Do you need a glass of water? Or uhm, a goblet
        of blood?
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part1_responce3
      Text: (Fresh) Damn, what got you lookin' all sweaty?
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part2
      Text: I ju... I just went for a nice evening... stroll.
      animation: default
    - ID: char1_day2_part3
      Text: A stroll that included vigorous running and jumping. And a very small
        tumble on my part.
      animation: sad
    - ID: char1_day2_part3
      Text: If you could take care of my hunting cloak, I would be most obliged.
      animation: happy
    - ID: char1_day2_part3_responce1
      Text: (Dry) Maybe you shouldn't hunt. Successful vampires let their prey come
        to them.
      animation: default
  char1: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bbf3a01f656b1a4429b4bfd7c1be7706, type: 2}
  char2: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b7f76945b20d817448832a1f5532fbd3, type: 2}
